{"id":"destino","lemma":"destino","pos":"noun","rank":750,"glosses":["destiny, fate","destination","purpose, end use"],"ipa":"/desˈtino/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"destinos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ac/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-destino.wav","examples":[{"text":"Creo en el destino.","en":"I believe in fate.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443386"},{"text":"Sus destinos estaban entrelazados.","en":"Their fates were entwined.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639837"},{"text":"Estás tentando al destino.","en":"You're tempting fate.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/455217"},{"text":"Aunque cada persona sigue un camino diferente, nuestros destinos son los mismos.","en":"Although each person follows a different path, our destinations are the same."},{"text":"¿Cuál es tu destino?","en":"What's our destination?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/604711"}]}